stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ASSIGNED : Create Mission
    ASSIGNED --> IN_PROGRESS : validateAndPerformChecks() == true
    ASSIGNED --> FAILED : validateAndPerformChecks() == false (Fail Reason & Release Agents)
    IN_PROGRESS --> IN_PROGRESS : advanceTime() (Duration < Required)
    IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : advanceTime() (Duration >= Required & Release Agents)
    IN_PROGRESS --> FAILED : Emergency / Abort (Release Agents)
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]